flowchart TD
    A["New requirement"] --> B{"Does existing code handle it\nwithout modification?"}
    B -->|"Yes"| C["Ship it — no pattern needed"]
    B -->|"No"| D{"Is there a second concrete\nuse case right now?"}
    D -->|"No"| E["Inline the solution\n(YAGNI — defer abstraction)"]
    D -->|"Yes"| F{"Is the duplication causing\nreal maintenance pain?"}
    F -->|"No"| G["Wait — note the smell"]
    F -->|"Yes"| H{"Identify the varying axis:\nbehaviour? construction? notification?"}
    H -->|"Behaviour varies"| I["Strategy / Command"]
    H -->|"Creation varies"| J["Factory / Builder"]
    H -->|"State notification varies"| K["Observer / Event emitter"]
    H -->|"Wrapping varies"| L["Decorator / Adapter"]

